        "D": "4"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Since 27 = 3^3, we have 3^(x + 1) = 3^3 => x + 1 = 3 => x = 2.",
      "explanation_short": "3^(x+1) = 3^3 => x = 2.",
      "explanation_pidgin": "27 na 3^3. So x + 1 = 3, meaning x = 2."
